<title>HONG KONG: Bank Niaga sets US$40 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank Niaga sets US$40 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Bayerische Landesbank Singapore.</p>
<p>BORROWER PT BANK NIAGA ACTING THROUGH ITS CAYMAN ISLANDS BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT	US$40 MLN				MATURITY    5 YRS</p>
<p> COUPON   YEARS 1-3 6ML+70 BP, YEARS 4-5 6ML+50 BP</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 3,4	CALLS     YR 3,4     REPLIES     04.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$500K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS STANDARD   PAY DATE    EARLY APR</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY INDONESIA  TAX PROV    NA</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-LEADS  US$4-5 MLN 51 BP ALL-IN 87</p>
<p>			    MANAGERS  US$2-3 MLN 48 BP ALL-IN 86</p>
<p>ARRANGER BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK SINGAPORE, SUMITOMO FINANCE</p>
<p>	    ASIA (JOINT BOOKRUNNERS)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
